flowchart LR
 NATIVE["native契約 api.md / diagnostics.md"] -->|session + strict JSON + event_id key| DIAG["readDiagnostic / Diagnostics.accept"]
 DIAG -->|tx: canonical hash / receipt / rate / fingerprint| DDB[("raw diagnostics / receipts / groups / sources")]
 DIAG -->|202 accepted / duplicate| NATIVE
 DIAG -->|409内容不一致 / rate / validation| NATIVE
 DDB --> ADMIN["diagnosticsAdmin: LAN peer+host / proxy拒否 / token"]
 ADMIN -->|GET出力時説明・注記・resolve/reopen| DDB
 USER["DELETE me"] --> REMOVE["Diagnostics.removeUser: 他userの寄与と共有状態保持"]
 REMOVE --> DDB
 STORE["native StoreKit JWS / Apple通知"] --> VERIFY["AppStore.verifier: Apple根まで署名・環境・app"]
 VERIFY -->|失敗/不一致| STORE
 VERIFY --> OWNER["original transaction / appAccountToken所有照合"]
 OWNER --> APPLY["AppStore.apply tx: 古い期限巻戻し防止"]
 APPLY --> SUB[("appstore_subscriptions + Accounts.setPlan")]
 SUB --> ME["Accounts.me / assertCanUse / setup gate"]
 TIME["main hourly"] --> PRUNE["diagnostics.prune / retention / attachments.gc / pairing / events"]
 PRUNE --> DDB

 LOCALE["shared/locales.ts: 5言語・正規化"] --> APIERR["server/errors.ts: status・extra / 純粋errorMessageへ委譲"]
 LOCALE --> I18N["web/i18n.ts: 選好・navigator・表示"]
 I18N --> FIXED["shared/error-translations.ts: 既知固定文だけ逆引き"]
